<title>USA: CCC SEEKS 7,000 T U.S. SPRING WHEAT FOR NICARAGUA.</title>
<headline>CCC SEEKS 7,000 T U.S. SPRING WHEAT FOR NICARAGUA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it was seeking up to 7,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 or better Northern Spring/Dark Northern spring wheat under its export program for donation to Nicaragua.</p>
<p>All whole grain wheat must be tested for vomitoxin, it said.</p>
<p>The CCC, which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said the shipment period was set for November 1-20.</p>
<p>Offers were due on August 21, it said.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
